  - `type BuilderAction = { type: "reset"; questions: Question[] } | { type: "select"; id: string | null } | { type: "addQuestion"; parentId: string | null; index?: number } | { type: "updateQuestion"; id: string; patch: Partial<Question> } | { type: "removeQuestions"; ids: string[] } | { type: "moveQuestion"; id: string; direction: "up" | "down" } | { type: "moveQuestions"; ids: string[]; targetParentId: string | null; index: number }`
  - `builderReducer(state: BuilderState, action: BuilderAction): BuilderState`
